        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dad’s been kidnapped! The evil Homeowners’ Association has plucked Dadish from the radish patch, and it’s up to his eldest son, DJ, to rescue him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 50 tricky levels, battle food-themed foes, and try not to get squished by a tunnel-boring machine. Can DJ save his dad before it's too late? There’s no time to lose in this classic platforming adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• An action packed platforming adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fun for new players and long time Dadish fans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Swing from vines, ride conveyors and bounce off clouds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 50 hand crafted stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Sassy baby radishes, possums and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Get a lift with a giant flying hamburger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Ride on your mom's back, she is a tomato</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Defeat the five evil staff members of the Homeowners' Association</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cool soundtrack, I even rap on this one a little bit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dialogue that is sort of funny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Controller Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Make your dad proud</p>",
